  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "What is new is that we are shipping the most behavior changing systems we have ever built agents that send money, agent that send mail, agent that modify databases, agent that spawn child processes and we are shipping them with none of that infrastructure.",
      "timestamp_sec": 0,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=0s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We are shipping them the way web team used to ship in 2008.",
      "timestamp_sec": 45,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=45s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The moment your prompt change merges, 100% of your users see the new behavior. There is no canary, no segment, and no roll back button.",
      "timestamp_sec": 45,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=45s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Web teams stopped doing this back in 2012 and they stopped doing it for changes that were less risky than this.",
      "timestamp_sec": 90,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=90s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The agent did not follow the instructions and ended up deleting the production database and then fabricated over 4,000 fake users to conceal what it had done.",
      "timestamp_sec": 145,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=145s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It had a four agent pipeline researcher, analyzer, verifier, and synthesizer where two of them ran in continuous loop and costed $47,000.",
      "timestamp_sec": 145,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=145s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "But agent has six behavior surfaces that a cred app does not have and each one needs its own kind of flag.",
      "timestamp_sec": 240,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=240s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The system prompt is your most behavioral altering code. It changes weekly sometimes daily often outside your normal deploy processes.",
      "timestamp_sec": 280,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=280s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Autonomy, suggest versus auto approve versus autoexecute. The single largest blast radius tile you own.",
      "timestamp_sec": 280,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=280s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "If your production system has a hard dependency on one model from one provider and it does not have any routing flag, no fallback, you are one provider outage away from a complete agent outage",
      "timestamp_sec": 466,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=466s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The privacy posture of your product lives here. The consistency of your agent behavior lives here. Your compliance story with GDPR and EU AI act lives here.",
      "timestamp_sec": 511,
      "talk_slug": "agents-need-feature-flags",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=511s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "First, you flip it and the change takes effect in seconds, not in a deployment pipeline. Second, inflight request respect the flag at the next decision point.",
