      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zU4EagB311U&t=1111s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "I'm not saying that coding agents are bad. I'm not saying they don't make us faster. I'm saying they they're creating a kind of debt that nobody is measuring.",
      "timestamp_sec": 0,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=0s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "the commits climbed 25% year over year. And now over the same year, comments on the comments dropped 27%",
      "timestamp_sec": 43,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=43s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Median PR review time is up by 441.5% and if you see like if you calculate, you'll figure out that the reviewed PRs take 5.4 times longer than what they used to.",
