      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=43s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "AI is producing the pull request very fast, but humans cannot responsibly review them at that pace.",
      "timestamp_sec": 100,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=100s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Every one of these numbers are real. None of them is a lie, but everyone is a vanity metric.",
      "timestamp_sec": 145,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=145s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "PR count goes up when one PR splits into seven PRs. Median PR size going up is not a benefit, it's actually a bloating. Cycle time going down when reviewers stop pushing back.",
      "timestamp_sec": 191,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=191s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "These things tell you the speed of production. They do not tell you the speed of trust.",
      "timestamp_sec": 191,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=191s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Tests are getting added, but they're actually asserting what the code did, not what the code should do. They lack in behavior, including bugs.",
      "timestamp_sec": 241,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=241s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It rhymes with technical debt, but it is more like a financial debt because it compounds. It actually accrues interest, but this interest is not money. This interest is paid in human attention.",
      "timestamp_sec": 286,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=286s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Code that was not deeply reviewed yesterday grounds tomorrow's PR. This debt becomes generative in nature.",
      "timestamp_sec": 286,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=286s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Once leadership sees the new throughput, you don't get to hire reviewers in proportion. There is no slack left to pay the debt back.",
      "timestamp_sec": 335,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=335s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The same PR, basically the score that you got for the same PR, will score differently when your model will change.",
      "timestamp_sec": 380,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=380s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "You want a number that is traceable to a deterministic computation",
      "timestamp_sec": 380,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=380s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Agents are biased toward fix at the call site. A human engineer routes a fix to the root cause.",
      "timestamp_sec": 429,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=429s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The review cost of a sprawling difference is not proportional to the size. It is actually much steeper.",
      "timestamp_sec": 429,
      "talk_slug": "reviewdebt-a-practical-framework-for-scoring-every-pull-request",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TJPInBjhE4Q&t=429s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
